                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Pennsylvania is proud to host the new National Guard training center at Penn State Health Milton S. Hershey Medical Center \u2013 the only such center on the East Coast. An inaugural cohort of 3 Air National Guard members underwent trauma and EMS training at the new center earlier this month. They then participated in a capstone mass casualty simulation event to earn their graduation from the program. My team was honored to be there to congratulate the very first graduating class of this prestigious program!",
