                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "The support provided by @TheArcPA to vulnerable individuals and their caregivers across the Commonwealth can be lifechanging. My team in the midstate attended the Arc\u2019s 2nd annual Disability Health Action Summit in Hershey, PA, to learn more about the theme of the summit, which is to \u201cAdvance Health Equity for People with Intellectual and Developmental Disabilities.\u201d I\u2019m grateful for the work that groups like the Arc do to advocate for Pennsylvanians with disabilities and their families.",
