                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Community health centers are the backbone of accessible, affordable care, and I\u2019m committed to strengthening them, so that every family has the support they need to live healthy, full lives. Today, I had the privilege of touring the Maria de Los Santos Health Center in Philadelphia, which serves as a vital resource for the community. Thankful to all the health care workers in our Commonwealth\u2014I see your work and I value it, and I\u2019m fighting to make sure you have the resources and workforce support you need.",
