                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "I\u2019m so glad to see this bipartisan legislation introduced in the PA Senate. Removing phones from classrooms will not only help students focus, but also protect them from the harmful effects of social media that too often interfere with learning and mental health. https://t.co/NBlLhF5ldz",
