                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "\u2705\u00a0Lowering Costs: By voting to renew the Trump tax cuts, increase and make permanent the Child Tax Credit to $2,200, raise the standard deduction that 90% of taxpayers claim, make the Paid Family and Medical Leave credit permanent, and create new deductions to fulfill the promise of no tax on tips and no tax on overtime \u2013 all signed into law by President Trump.",
