                "text": "I support access to safe, effective vaccines like measles and Hep B. I also hear a lot of skepticism directed at the public health establishment, especially in the wake of COVID and the mistreatment of those who did not get the COVID shot. We need public health rooted in science and trust and we need to get this right.",
