                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Great start to the week visiting with Anson Flake at Aurelius in Harrisburg. Aurelius is a brain health and human performance lab that is taking a holistic approach to treating PTSD, TBI, and the other challenges so many of our nation\u2019s veterans face. I\u2019m grateful to Anson and his team for their commitment to helping our military heroes overcome the mental wounds of war and make the successful transition back to civilian life.",
