                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "I was truly humbled to speak at the Union League of Philadelphia\u2019s Veterans Day Lunch about the urgent need to make personalized and innovative mental health treatments available to our service men and women and end the crisis of veterans suicide in our country. \n\nI also had the privilege of meeting so many great patriots who bravely served our nation, especially PFC Jake Ruser who stormed the beaches of Normandy on D-Day - a true American hero among us. \ud83c\uddfa\ud83c\uddf8",
